{"id": "b9dae184-e5f0-4f06-9ef0-9e5a609b93f7", "slug": "futuristic-interface-section", "title": "Futuristic Interface Section", "description": "Futuristic Interface Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Futuristic Interface Section\"\ndescription: \"Futuristic Interface Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF6B35\"\n  secondary: \"#151518\"\n  accent: \"#FCA311\"\n  background: \"#09090B\"\n  surface: \"#151518\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#232326\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Futuristic Interface Section\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 120; favorites: 24; remixes: 5.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nFuturistic Interface Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nSkeder Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore. Select mode Merthors Yous Phars Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Initialize Herar Lorem…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Skeder; Merthors; Yous Phars; Herar; Skertaray; Skertaroy.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF6B35, secondary #151518, accent #FCA311, background #09090B, surface #151518, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Futuristic Interface Section</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n        /* Utility to hide scrollbar for clean look */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#09090b] text-white overflow-hidden w-full h-screen relative antialiased selection:bg-[#ff6b35] selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- Ambient WebGL-style Canvas Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"ambient-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-60\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Main Viewport Section -->\n    <section class=\"relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center z-10 overflow-hidden\">\n\n        <!-- Scaling Container to preserve absolute layout perfectly on all screens -->\n        <div id=\"scene-container\" class=\"relative w-[1200px] h-[800px] origin-center scale-[0.4] sm:scale-[0.55] md:scale-[0.75] lg:scale-[0.9] xl:scale-100 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out\">\n\n            <!-- Massive Background Plate (Folder Shape) -->\n            <div id=\"bg-plate\" class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[980px] h-[640px] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#232326] to-[#121214] border border-white/5 shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\"\n                 style=\"clip-path: polygon(0 60px, 60px 0, calc(50% - 100px) 0, calc(50% - 80px) 40px, calc(50% + 80px) 40px, calc(50% + 100px) 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%); border-radius: 40px;\">\n                <!-- Decorative grid inside bg plate -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAiIHhtbG5zPSJodHRwOi8vd3d3LnczLm9yZy8yMDAwL3N2ZyI+PGNpcmNsZSBjeD0iMSIgY3k9IjEiIHI9IjEiIGZpbGw9InJnYmEoMjU1LDI1NSwyNTUsMC4wMykiLz48L3N2Zz4=')] opacity-50\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 1: Top Left (Skeder) -->\n            <div class=\"ui-element absolute left-[2%] top-[8%] w-[340px] h-[210px] z-20 group\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full p-[1px] rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ff6b35]/60 via-white/5 to-transparent relative\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#ff6b35]/20 blur-xl rounded-[2rem] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#222225] to-[#151518] rounded-[2rem] p-7 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <!-- Abstract bg image -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute right-[-20%] top-[-20%] w-[150%] h-[150%] opacity-10 mix-blend-screen pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: url('https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/724142aa-44a6-48d3-9cf3-761e00d05b78_1600w.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;\"></div>\n\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n                            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-2\">Skeder</h2>\n                            <p class=\"text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-gray-400 max-w-[60%]\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"relative z-10 w-fit px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#ff6b35] to-[#fca311] text-white text-xs font-medium shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,107,53,0.4)] hover:shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(255,107,53,0.6)] transition-shadow\">\n                            Select mode\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2: Mid Left (Merthors) -->\n            <div class=\"ui-element absolute left-[15%] top-[42%] w-[280px] h-[130px] z-10 group\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full p-[1px] rounded-[1.5rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-transparent\">\n                    <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#1c1c1f] rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 flex flex-col justify-center relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <!-- Gear decoration -->\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" class=\"absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 text-[100px] text-white/5 -rotate-45 group-hover:rotate-90 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out\"></iconify-icon>\n\n                        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-4 relative z-10\">Merthors</h2>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-2 relative z-10 items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#ff6b35] shadow-[0_0_8px_#ff6b35]\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#ff6b35]/50\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#ff6b35]/20\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 3: Bottom Left (Yous Phars) -->\n            <div class=\"ui-element absolute left-[4%] top-[65%] w-[320px] h-[160px] z-30\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(20px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 20px), calc(100% - 20px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 20px);\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#252528] to-[#111113] p-6 flex flex-col justify-between border border-white/10 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] relative overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#ff6b35]/10 to-transparent opacity-0 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-2\">Yous Phars</h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-[9px] leading-relaxed text-gray-500 max-w-[70%]\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center relative z-10\">\n                        <button class=\"px-5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#ff6b35]/20 text-[#ff6b35] border border-[#ff6b35]/50 text-xs font-medium hover:bg-[#ff6b35] hover:text-white transition-colors\">\n                            Initialize\n                        </button>\n                        <!-- Custom Toggle -->\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-5 rounded-full bg-black/60 border border-white/10 flex items-center px-1 cursor-pointer toggle-btn\">\n                            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-white transform transition-transform duration-300 toggle-knob\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 4: Center Prominent (Herar) -->\n            <div id=\"center-card\" class=\"ui-element absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-[45%] w-[580px] h-[320px] z-50\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full p-[1px] rounded-[2.5rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ff6b35] via-white/10 to-transparent relative shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]\">\n                    <!-- Glow effect behind -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute -inset-2 bg-[#ff6b35]/20 blur-2xl rounded-[3rem] -z-10 animate-pulse\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1e1e21] to-[#0a0a0c] rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 flex relative overflow-hidden\">\n\n                        <!-- Left Content -->\n                        <div class=\"w-[45%] h-full flex flex-col justify-center relative z-10 pr-4\">\n                            <h1 class=\"text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-3\">Herar</h1>\n                            <p class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-gray-400 mb-6\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim.</p>\n                            <button class=\"w-fit px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#ff6b35] to-[#fca311] text-white text-sm font-medium shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(255,107,53,0.5)] hover:scale-105 transition-transform\">\n                                Deploy Node\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Right Tech Graphic -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[55%] h-[85%] rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-sm overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center group\">\n                            <!-- Technical graph lines simulated with SVG -->\n                            <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-30\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                                <path id=\"sine-wave\" d=\"M0,50 Q25,20 50,50 T100,50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff6b35\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" />\n                                <path d=\"M0,70 Q25,90 50,70 T100,70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"0.2\" />\n                            </svg>\n                            <!-- Image Asset simulating hardware -->\n                            <div class=\"w-[90%] h-[80%] rounded-xl bg-[url('https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/5ee0a38a-b5d3-4531-8793-98beed4af162_1600w.jpg')] bg-cover bg-center mix-blend-luminosity opacity-80 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-1000\"></div>\n\n                            <!-- Overlay UI elements on hardware -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 flex gap-1\">\n                                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#ff6b35] rounded-full animate-ping\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white/50 rounded-full\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 text-[8px] font-mono text-[#ff6b35]\">SYS.OP.492</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 5: Bottom Mid (Skertaray) -->\n            <div class=\"ui-element absolute left-[35%] top-[72%] w-[380px] h-[150px] z-40 rounded-[2rem] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-white/10 to-transparent\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#1a1a1d] rounded-[2rem] p-6 flex justify-between items-center relative overflow-hidden\">\n                    <!-- Abstract geometric bg -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-5 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iNDAiIGhlaWdodD0iNDAiIHhtbG5zPSJodHRwOi8vd3d3LnczLm9yZy8yMDAwL3N2ZyI+PHBhdGggZD0iTTAgMGg0MHY0MEgweiIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIvPjxwaGF0IGQ9Ik0wIDBsNDAgNDBNNDAgMGwtNDAgNDAiIHN0cm9rZT0iI2ZmZiIHN0cm9rZS13aWR0aD0iMC41Ii8+PC9zdmc+')]\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"w-[60%] relative z-10\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-2\">Skertaray</h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-[9px] leading-relaxed text-gray-500\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor.</p>\n                        <!-- Custom Toggle 2 -->\n                        <div class=\"mt-4 w-12 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#ff6b35]/20 border border-[#ff6b35]/50 flex items-center px-1 cursor-pointer relative auto-toggle\">\n                            <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-[#ff6b35] shadow-[0_0_10px_#ff6b35] absolute left-1 transition-all duration-300 knob\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Visual Indicator -->\n                    <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-black/30 flex items-center justify-center relative z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-[#ff6b35] border-t-transparent animate-spin\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute w-3 h-3 bg-[#ff6b35] rounded-full shadow-[0_0_15px_#ff6b35]\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 6: Top Right (Image/Hardware Focus) -->\n            <div class=\"ui-element absolute right-[2%] top-[5%] w-[420px] h-[240px] z-10 group\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 30px), calc(100% - 30px) 100%, 0 100%);\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#151518] relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col p-6\">\n                    <!-- Background Image acting as hardware -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full bg-[url('https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/005600e5-f6ab-4e59-bc86-eaeb02797dfa_1600w.jpg')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-40 mix-blend-luminosity group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-1000\" id=\"pan-image\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#151518] via-[#151518]/80 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex justify-between w-full\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-linear\" class=\"text-white/50 text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <button class=\"px-4 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-[10px] text-white/70 hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-colors\">Config</button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-auto\">\n                        <!-- Navigation dots -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute right-0 bottom-0 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-white/30 rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-white/30 rounded-full\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 7: Mid Right (Skertaroy) -->\n            <div class=\"ui-element absolute right-[5%] top-[45%] w-[320px] h-[140px] z-30 rounded-[2rem] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 via-transparent to-[#ff6b35]/30\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#1c1c1f] rounded-[2rem] p-6 flex items-center justify-between relative overflow-hidden group\">\n                    <div class=\"w-[70%] relative z-10\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-2\">Skertaroy</h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-[9px] leading-relaxed text-gray-500\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit minim.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Icon -->\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-[#ff6b35]/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center relative z-10 group-hover:bg-[#ff6b35] transition-colors duration-300\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" class=\"text-[#ff6b35] text-2xl group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 8: Bottom Right (Sckethars) -->\n            <div class=\"ui-element absolute right-[8%] top-[68%] w-[400px] h-[190px] z-20 group\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 20px) 0, 100% 20px, 100% 100%, 20px 100%, 0 calc(100% - 20px));\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#202023] to-[#111113] p-7 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden border-t border-l border-white/5\">\n\n                    <!-- Hardware graphic simulated -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute right-[-10%] bottom-[-20%] w-[200px] h-[200px] bg-black rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-50\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-linear\" class=\"absolute right-4 bottom-4 text-[120px] text-white/5 group-hover:text-white/10 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-2\">Sckethars</h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-gray-400 max-w-[50%]\">Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"relative z-10 w-fit px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#ff6b35] to-[#e85d04] text-white text-xs font-medium mt-4 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,107,53,0.2)]\">\n                        Establish Link\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <script>\n        // Wait for DOM\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n\n            // --- 1. Canvas Ambient WebGL Simulation (Particle Nexus) ---\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('ambient-canvas');\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n            let width, height;\n            let particles = [];\n\n            function resizeCanvas() {\n                width = window.innerWidth;\n                height = window.innerHeight;\n                canvas.width = width;\n                canvas.height = height;\n            }\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resizeCanvas);\n            resizeCanvas();\n\n            class Particle {\n                constructor() {\n                    this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                    this.y = Math.random() * height;\n                    this.vx = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5;\n                    this.vy = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5;\n                    this.radius = Math.random() * 1.5;\n                    this.baseAlpha = Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.1;\n                    this.color = Math.random() > 0.8 ? '#ff6b35' : '#ffffff';\n                }\n                update() {\n                    this.x += this.vx;\n                    this.y += this.vy;\n                    if (this.x < 0 || this.x > width) this.vx *= -1;\n                    if (this.y < 0 || this.y > height) this.vy *= -1;\n                }\n                draw() {\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.radius, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    ctx.fillStyle = this.color;\n                    ctx.globalAlpha = this.baseAlpha;\n                    ctx.fill();\n                }\n            }\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < 80; i++) particles.push(new Particle());\n\n            function animateCanvas() {\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n                // Draw connections\n                for (let i = 0; i < particles.length; i++) {\n                    for (let j = i + 1; j < particles.length; j++) {\n                        const dx = particles[i].x - particles[j].x;\n                        const dy = particles[i].y - particles[j].y;\n                        const dist = Math.sqrt(dx*dx + dy*dy);\n\n                        if (dist < 150) {\n                            ctx.beginPath();\n                            ctx.strokeStyle = particles[i].color === '#ff6b35' || particles[j].color === '#ff6b35' ? '#ff6b35' : '#ffffff';\n                            ctx.globalAlpha = (1 - dist/150) * 0.15;\n                            ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n                            ctx.moveTo(particles[i].x, particles[i].y);\n                            ctx.lineTo(particles[j].x, particles[j].y);\n                            ctx.stroke();\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                particles.forEach(p => {\n                    p.update();\n                    p.draw();\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateCanvas);\n            }\n            animateCanvas();\n\n            // --- 2. GSAP Entrance & Ambient Animations ---\n\n            // Master Entrance Timeline\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power3.out\" } });\n\n            // Animate background plate first\n            tl.from(\"#bg-plate\", {\n                scale: 0.8,\n                opacity: 0,\n                duration: 1.5,\n                ease: \"back.out(1.2)\"\n            })\n            // Stagger in the UI elements from center outward\n            .from(\".ui-element\", {\n                y: 50,\n                opacity: 0,\n                scale: 0.9,\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: {\n                    amount: 0.8,\n                    from: \"center\"\n                }\n            }, \"-=1\");\n\n            // Ambient Animations (Continuous)\n\n            // 1. Slow pan of the image in top right card\n            gsap.to(\"#pan-image\", {\n                backgroundPosition: \"100% 50%\",\n                duration: 20,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1\n            });\n\n            // 2. Animate the SVG sine wave in center card\n            gsap.to(\"#sine-wave\", {\n                attr: { d: \"M0,50 Q25,80 50,50 T100,50\" },\n                duration: 2,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1\n            });\n\n            // 3. Subtle floating on specific peripheral cards to feel alive\n            const floatCards = document.querySelectorAll('.ui-element:not(#center-card)');\n            floatCards.forEach((card, index) => {\n                gsap.to(card, {\n                    y: `+=${Math.random() > 0.5 ? 8 : -8}`,\n                    x: `+=${Math.random() > 0.5 ? 4 : -4}`,\n                    rotationZ: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 1,\n                    duration: 3 + Math.random() * 2,\n                    ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                    yoyo: true,\n                    repeat: -1,\n                    delay: Math.random() * 2\n                });\n            });\n\n            // --- 3. Interactive Toggles ---\n\n            // Manual toggle\n            const toggleBtn = document.querySelector('.toggle-btn');\n            const toggleKnob = document.querySelector('.toggle-knob');\n            let isToggled = false;\n\n            toggleBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                isToggled = !isToggled;\n                if(isToggled) {\n                    toggleBtn.classList.replace('bg-black/60', 'bg-[#ff6b35]/40');\n                    toggleKnob.classList.replace('bg-white', 'bg-[#ff6b35]');\n                    toggleKnob.classList.add('translate-x-5');\n                } else {\n                    toggleBtn.classList.replace('bg-[#ff6b35]/40', 'bg-black/60');\n                    toggleKnob.classList.replace('bg-[#ff6b35]', 'bg-white');\n                    toggleKnob.classList.remove('translate-x-5');\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Auto-animating toggle for ambient motion\n            const autoKnob = document.querySelector('.auto-toggle .knob');\n            gsap.to(autoKnob, {\n                x: 24, // width of container (48) - padding (4) - knob (16) roughly\n                duration: 0.4,\n                ease: \"power2.inOut\",\n                repeat: -1,\n                repeatDelay: 3,\n                yoyo: true\n            });\n\n            // Parallax effect on mouse move for the whole container\n            const container = document.getElementById('scene-container');\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const xAxis = (window.innerWidth / 2 - e.pageX) / 50;\n                const yAxis = (window.innerHeight / 2 - e.pageY) / 50;\n                gsap.to(container, {\n                    x: xAxis,\n                    y: yAxis,\n                    duration: 1,\n                    ease: \"power1.out\"\n                });\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "futuristic-interface-section.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/futuristic-interface-section.jpg", "source_name": "futuristic-interface-section-DESIGN.md", "views": 311, "forks": 11, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T13:57:12.950959+00:00"}